works: It lifts slowly, the way weather lifts: one morning {N} notices the light before noticing the weight.
works: The weeks are still heavy, but {N} is no longer carrying them alone, and that changes how they feel.
fails: The low weeks run on longer than {N} hoped. They are still weeks, though, and they keep moving.
fails: The plan does not help much this time; {N} sets it down gently and keeps looking for what will.

