- U>R | apologise for the worst thing said, and explain what was really meant | v: self-direction, benevolence | repair: repair | foot: means ties+.03 | chance: 80
- B>G | hold the line on the debt together: nothing new until it is cleared | v: security, benevolence | repair: boundary | foot: means money+.03 | chance: 70
